  "Busy machine: measured on the owner's everyday Mac with many other processes running (ChatGPT/Codex, Claude, Steam, browsers). Free RAM swung between about 10 and 17.5 GB of 32 GB and macOS swapped during tests. Actual performance on a quieter machine may be better; not measured.",
