  "OS page cache uncontrolled: some expert reads may have been served from memory rather than the SSD.",
  "Lossy settings change the model's computation; small prompt sets are smoke tests, not quality benchmarks.",
  "0.10 tok/s starting point is user-reported; the installed engine later refused to start at all for lack of free RAM."
